6:   const causes = ['a single blow to the head','a dose of a rare sedative','a fatal wound from a letter opener','smoke inhalation in a locked room','a fall from the mezzanine','poison concealed in a nightcap','a gunshot wound at close range','a strangulation using a silk cord','a staged electrical accident','a deep cut from broken glass'];
