46:       {icon:'✚', type:'MEDICAL EXAMINER', title:'Coroner’s report', body:`Cause of death: ${cause}. Estimated time of death: ${time}, plus or minus twenty minutes. No defensive wounds were found, suggesting the victim knew the visitor or was taken by surprise. The victim’s final meal was untouched.`},
47:       {icon:'▧', type:'WITNESS STATEMENT', title:`Interview: ${witness}`, body:`“I heard the service door close just after ${time}. I caught a glimpse of someone leaving, but the rain had blurred the street. There was a sharp smell of ${culprit.trace} in the corridor. I thought it was coming from the workroom.”`},
